  "notes": [
    "-IR verb with e→ie stem change in Presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras)",
    "In the Pretérito Indefinido, the stem changes to e→i in él/ella/usted (convirtió) and ellos/ellas/ustedes (convirtieron)",
    "The same e→i change occurs in the gerund: convirtiendo",
    "Past participle: convertido (regular)",
    "Commonly used with \"en\": convertir algo en algo = to turn/convert something into something",
    "The reflexive form \"convertirse\" means to become/to be converted"
  ],
